1 NAME Sigmund Jenssen /Borgan/
2 GIVN Sigmund Jenssen
2 _MARNM Borgan
1 SEX M
1 BAPM
2 PLAC Ukjent
2 ADDR
1 BIRT
2 DATE 19 JUN 1920
