1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Ragnhild apparently came to Kristiansund, following her Uncle Svend Wold -- who was husband #3 for Johanne Cathrine Bie (her 1st husband was Ole Mortensen Helsing).  
2 CONT
2 CONT Ragnild's 1st marriage was to widower Christen Hansen - whose 1st wife was Else Kathrine Helsing - only sister to Morten Olaus Helsing. After Christen died, and Morten's 1st wife had died -- Morten & Ragnild were married and had m
2 CONC any, many children - almost all of whom survived to adulthood.
2 CONT
2 CONT In skifte for Morten Olaus dated 28 January 1836, Ragnild was shown as his widow.  Norsk portrætarkiv states her death year as 1846.
2 CONT
2 CONT Billedkilde: norsk portrætarkiv.
