1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Morten Olaus was confirmed in Kristiansund on 29 October 1775.
2 CONT
2 CONT Morten Olaus' 1st wife was Johanna Magaretha Thode (skifte signed   3 June 1797; died 25 Nov. 1796) and had 3 sons: Niels Thode b. ca 1785; Ole Maarten b. ca 1790; and Henrich Christian b. ca 1791,  All 3 sons were alive at 1801 c
2 CONC ensus.  But Niels was no longer alive at skifte of unmarried brother Henrich Christian 20 December 1823.
2 CONT
2 CONT I 1801 bosat på Kirkelandet, Kr.sund
2 CONT
2 CONT Bager og købmand.
2 CONT
2 CONT Gift med Johanne før 1785.
2 CONT
2 CONT Gift med Ragnhild 8. juni 1797 i Kristiansund, Norge
2 CONT
