1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Christopher Charles Paus, F.C.A., was a chartered accountant in the United Kingdom.
2 CONT
2 CONT We have learned with regret of the sudden death on October 20th, at the age of 52, of Mr. C. C. Paus, F.C.A. Educated at Repton, he served articles with J. Heselton & Sons, of Bradford, and was admitted as Associate of The Institu
2 CONC te of Chartered Accountants in England and Wales in 1933. Since 1953, Mr Paus had been in the service of British Tabulating Machine Co, now I.C.T. Ltd, and was known to many members of the profession through his connection with th
2 CONC at company's liaison seme* with accountants.
2 CONT
2 CONT The Accountant, Volum 145, 1962
2 CONT
2 CONT https://books.google.com/books?id=CuwWAQAAMAAJ
