1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 1778-Vitals-Edvard Christian to Antoni Handrup Edvardsen
2 CONT
2 CONT register pg 180D-5th Aprilis Dobt Antoni Handrup Edvardssen ytre Oye B. Edvard Christian. Wit-Johanes Aamoed, Niels Edvardsen yt. Oye, Mon Jonas Schanike ibd. Lisbete Cecilia yt. Oye, Esther Qvale.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1801 census Oye Ytre, Qvinnesdal, Lister & Mandal, age 24 Kvinesdal bygdebok #9, p. 554, vol. I, a glassmaker.  He made the model ship that hangs in Kvinesdal church, sometime before 1814.
2 CONT
2 CONT DEATH NOTE Anen Arli, Kvinesdal ei bygdebok; vol.1 gards- og aettesoga, p.554
2 CONT
2 CONT #9. Glassmaker Edvard Antonisen dead 1849, married 1798 to Marthe Hansdatter Oye, who died in 1861. Edvard sold some land to Jens Henrik Beer.' Oye, who died in 1861.
2 CONT
2 CONT DEATH-Kvinesdal register-p. 177 line 27: Edvard Aamodt, 80, 26 Apr 1849 Ytre Oye.
