2 FORM jpg
2 TITL In the Church in Kvinesdal
2 _PRIM Y
2 NOTE This is a picture of the ship that hangs in the church in Kvinesdal, Norway.  It was made by our ancestor, Edvard Christian Antonisen, and because we have no photo of him, we are adding the ship.  It was a very special moment to v
3 CONC isit the church in May 2008 and view the ship in person.  I will add a couple more shots taken in May.
3 CONT Dave C.
